{"seq":1,"slug":"remote-and-fetch","title":"远程与拉取","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/git-version-control/collaboration/remote-and-fetch","wordCount":615,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"远程与拉取\">远程与拉取</h1><h2 id=\"远程仓库基础\">远程仓库基础</h2><p><strong>远程仓库（Remote）</strong> 是托管在网络上的 Git 仓库副本。Git 的分布式架构允许每个开发者拥有完整的仓库副本，通过远程仓库同步变更。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git remote -v&#10;&#10;git remote add origin https://github.com/user/repo.git&#10;git remote add upstream https://github.com/org/repo.git&#10;&#10;git remote rename origin old-origin&#10;git remote remove old-origin\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> remote</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -v</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> remote</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> origin</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> https://github.com/user/repo.git</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> remote</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> upstream</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> https://github.com/org/repo.git</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> remote</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> rename</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> origin</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> old-origin</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> remote</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> remove</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> old-origin</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>远程名称</th>\n<th>惯例用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>origin</td>\n<td>自己 fork 的仓库或主仓库</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>upstream</td>\n<td>原始仓库（fork 场景）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>staging</td>\n<td>预发布环境仓库</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"fetch-与-pull\">Fetch 与 Pull</h2><p><strong>Fetch</strong> 从远程下载新数据但不合并，<strong>Pull</strong> 是 fetch + merge 的快捷方式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git fetch origin&#10;git fetch --all&#10;git fetch origin main&#10;&#10;git pull origin main&#10;git pull --rebase origin main&#10;git pull --ff-only origin main\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> fetch</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> origin</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> fetch</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --all</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> fetch</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> origin</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> main</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> pull</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> origin</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> main</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> pull</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --rebase</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> origin</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> main</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> pull</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --ff-only</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> origin</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> main</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[远程仓库] --&gt;|fetch| B[远程跟踪分支 origin/main]&#10;    B --&gt;|merge| C[本地分支 main]&#10;    A --&gt;|pull| C\">graph LR\n    A[远程仓库] --&gt;|fetch| B[远程跟踪分支 origin/main]\n    B --&gt;|merge| C[本地分支 main]\n    A --&gt;|pull| C</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>命令</th>\n<th>行为</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>git fetch</code></td>\n<td>仅下载，不合并</td>\n<td>查看远程变更</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>git pull</code></td>\n<td>fetch + merge</td>\n<td>快速同步</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>git pull --rebase</code></td>\n<td>fetch + rebase</td>\n<td>保持线性历史</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>git pull --ff-only</code></td>\n<td>仅快进合并，有分叉则失败</td>\n<td>安全同步</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 推荐在团队中统一使用 <code>git pull --rebase</code> 或配置 <code>pull.rebase=true</code>，避免产生不必要的合并 commit。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>远程协作围绕&quot;本地引用如何与远端保持一致&quot;展开：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>远程仓库</td>\n<td>网络上的仓库副本，以 origin 等别名引用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>远程跟踪分支</td>\n<td>本地缓存的远端状态（如 origin/main）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Fetch</td>\n<td>只下载不合并，更新远程跟踪分支</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pull</td>\n<td>fetch + merge（或 rebase）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跟踪关系</td>\n<td>本地分支与远程分支的绑定（upstream）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>修剪</td>\n<td>删除远端已不存在的跟踪分支</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"push-推送\">Push 推送</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git push origin main&#10;git push -u origin feature/login&#10;git push --force-with-lease origin feature/login&#10;&#10;git push origin --delete feature/old-branch&#10;git push origin :feature/old-branch&#10;&#10;git push --tags&#10;git push origin v1.0.0\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> push</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> origin</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> main</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> push</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -u</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> origin</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> feature/login</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> push</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --force-with-lease</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> origin</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> feature/login</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> push</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> origin</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --delete</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> feature/old-branch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> push</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> origin</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> :feature/old-branch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> push</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --tags</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> push</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> origin</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> v1.0.0</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>选项</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>-u</code> / <code>--set-upstream</code></td>\n<td>设置上游跟踪关系</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>--force</code></td>\n<td>强制推送（危险）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>--force-with-lease</code></td>\n<td>安全强制推送（检查远程是否有更新）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>--tags</code></td>\n<td>推送所有标签</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>--delete</code></td>\n<td>删除远程分支</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 永远使用 <code>--force-with-lease</code> 替代 <code>--force</code>。它会检查远程分支是否被其他人更新过，防止覆盖他人的工作。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"upstream-跟踪关系\">Upstream 跟踪关系</h2><p><strong>跟踪关系（Tracking）</strong> 将本地分支与远程分支关联，使 <code>git pull</code> 和 <code>git push</code> 可以省略参数：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git branch -vv&#10;&#10;git branch --set-upstream-to=origin/main main&#10;git branch -u origin/feature feature/login&#10;&#10;git checkout --track origin/feature/new&#10;&#10;git config --global push.default current\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> branch</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -vv</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> branch</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --set-upstream-to=origin/main</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> main</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> branch</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -u</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> origin/feature</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> feature/login</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> checkout</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --track</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> origin/feature/new</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --global</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> push.default</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> current</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    L[本地 main] --&gt;|tracks| R[origin/main]&#10;    L2[本地 feature] --&gt;|tracks| R2[origin/feature]&#10;    L3[本地 hotfix] -.-&gt;|no upstream| X[未设置]\">graph TD\n    L[本地 main] --&gt;|tracks| R[origin/main]\n    L2[本地 feature] --&gt;|tracks| R2[origin/feature]\n    L3[本地 hotfix] -.-&gt;|no upstream| X[未设置]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"多远程仓库管理\">多远程仓库管理</h2><p>Fork 工作流中通常需要管理多个远程：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git remote add upstream https://github.com/org/original-repo.git&#10;git fetch upstream&#10;git merge upstream/main&#10;# 或&#10;git rebase upstream/main&#10;&#10;git push origin main\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> remote</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> upstream</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> https://github.com/org/original-repo.git</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> fetch</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> upstream</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> merge</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> upstream/main</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 或</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> rebase</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> upstream/main</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> push</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> origin</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> main</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    U[upstream: 原始仓库] --&gt;|fetch| L[本地仓库]&#10;    L --&gt;|push| O[origin: fork 仓库]&#10;    O --&gt;|PR| U\">graph LR\n    U[upstream: 原始仓库] --&gt;|fetch| L[本地仓库]\n    L --&gt;|push| O[origin: fork 仓库]\n    O --&gt;|PR| U</pre><p>同步 fork 的完整流程：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git fetch upstream&#10;git checkout main&#10;git rebase upstream/main&#10;git push origin main --force-with-lease&#10;&#10;git checkout feature/my-work&#10;git rebase main\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> fetch</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> upstream</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> checkout</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> main</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> rebase</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> upstream/main</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> push</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> origin</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> main</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --force-with-lease</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> checkout</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> feature/my-work</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> rebase</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> main</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"远程分支清理\">远程分支清理</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"git remote prune origin&#10;git fetch --prune&#10;&#10;git config --global fetch.prune true&#10;&#10;git branch -r&#10;git branch -d feature/merged&#10;git branch -D feature/abandoned\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> remote</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> prune</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> origin</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> fetch</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --prune</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> config</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --global</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> fetch.prune</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> branch</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -r</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> branch</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -d</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> feature/merged</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">git</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> branch</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -D</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> feature/abandoned</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>命令</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>git remote prune origin</code></td>\n<td>删除本地的失效远程跟踪分支</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>git fetch --prune</code></td>\n<td>fetch 时同步删除失效跟踪分支</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>git branch -d</code></td>\n<td>删除已合并的本地分支</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>git branch -D</code></td>\n<td>强制删除本地分支</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((远程与拉取))&#10;    Remote&#10;      origin / upstream&#10;      多远程管理&#10;      prune 清理&#10;    Fetch&#10;      仅下载不合并&#10;      --all 全部远程&#10;    Pull&#10;      fetch + merge&#10;      --rebase 变基&#10;      --ff-only 安全&#10;    Push&#10;      --force-with-lease&#10;      -u 设置 upstream&#10;      --tags 推送标签&#10;    Tracking&#10;      branch -vv&#10;      --set-upstream-to\">mindmap\n  root((远程与拉取))\n    Remote\n      origin / upstream\n      多远程管理\n      prune 清理\n    Fetch\n      仅下载不合并\n      --all 全部远程\n    Pull\n      fetch + merge\n      --rebase 变基\n      --ff-only 安全\n    Push\n      --force-with-lease\n      -u 设置 upstream\n      --tags 推送标签\n    Tracking\n      branch -vv\n      --set-upstream-to</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>Remote</strong> 是远程仓库的本地别名，<code>origin</code> 和 <code>upstream</code> 是最常见的命名惯例</li>\n<li><strong>Fetch</strong> 只下载不合并，是查看远程变更的安全方式；<strong>Pull</strong> 是 fetch + merge 的快捷方式</li>\n<li>推荐使用 <code>git pull --rebase</code> 保持线性历史，配置 <code>pull.rebase=true</code> 设为默认行为</li>\n<li><strong>Push</strong> 时使用 <code>--force-with-lease</code> 替代 <code>--force</code>，防止覆盖他人的提交</li>\n<li>定期使用 <code>--prune</code> 清理失效的远程跟踪分支，保持仓库整洁</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"远程与拉取","id":"远程与拉取"},{"level":2,"text":"远程仓库基础","id":"远程仓库基础"},{"level":2,"text":"Fetch 与 Pull","id":"fetch-与-pull"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Push 推送","id":"push-推送"},{"level":2,"text":"Upstream 跟踪关系","id":"upstream-跟踪关系"},{"level":2,"text":"多远程仓库管理","id":"多远程仓库管理"},{"level":2,"text":"远程分支清理","id":"远程分支清理"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"历史重写","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/git-version-control/advanced-operations/filter-and-rewrite"},"next":{"title":"Pull Request 工作流","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/git-version-control/collaboration/pull-request-workflow"}}